    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0439",
      "reading_order": 464,
      "section": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 328.5354,
        "t": 738.0270068359374,
        "r": 557.1018,
        "b": 727.2077469606776
      },
      "content": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_464",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7. Generator Set/Regulator Tests"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_464",
          "title": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 40,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0440",
      "reading_order": 465,
      "section": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.9386,
        "t": 712.7610068359376,
        "r": 564.8118999999999,
        "b": 652.2762492035389
      },
      "content": "Isolate the stator windings by disconnecting all six stator leads.  Test for open circuits between T1-T2, T3-T4 and Q1-Q2, and for grounded circuits between T1, T3 and B1 and the stator laminations or other unpainted grounding point.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_464",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7. Generator Set/Regulator Tests"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_464",
          "title": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR"
        }
      ],
      "page": 40,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0441",
      "reading_order": 466,
      "section": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.93860000000006,
        "t": 635.6598068359376,
        "r": 564.7678999999997,
        "b": 613.1019492035389
      },
      "content": "Using proper test equipment, check the stator for grounds, opens, and shorts in the windings.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_464",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7. Generator Set/Regulator Tests"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_464",
          "title": "[C] TESTING GENERATOR SET STATOR"
        }
      ],
      "page": 40,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
